        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Oruganikyo orw'orugonjo",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inywe enzarwa za Yerusaalemu n'abantu ba Yuda, nimbasaba mutucweremu, nyowe n'orugonjo rwange. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kiki ekindi ekikaba nikyetaagwa okukora omu rugonjo rwange oru ekirutarakoliirwe? Nyowe obu nanihiire nti ruranyanira emizabbibbu erukunura, habwaki rwayanire erukusarra? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lero hati nu, kambagambire ekindukwija kukora orugonjo rwange runu ninyija kurwihaho orugo rwarwo, nukwo rwonerwe kimu; ninyija kuseesa ekisiika kyarwo nukwo rurubatirirwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninyija kurunaga; tiruligaruka kulimwa n'okusalirwa nukwo ruhuuke, rumerwemu amahwa n'amakerre; kandi ninyija kuragira ebicu, bireke kurunagira enjura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balikibona abo abarurukanira kwongera amaju ha gandi, n'emisiri hamisiri endi; okuhika obu bakamarrahokimu ensi yoona, omuntu akaburwa obwikaro, yoona ekaba yabo bakagyemarra. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA ow'amahe akarahira mmuhuliriize yagamba ati: “Mazimakwo, amaju maingi galiba bifuruka amaju amarungi amakooto, galiburwa ow'okugaraaramu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu engonjo ikumi ezemizabbibbu zirirugwamu lita munaana, n'ensahu ibiri ez'embibo zirirugwamu ekigega kimu kyonka.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "WIS.2.7+WIS.2.8+WIS.2.9"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ama 2:7-9",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balikibona abo abazinduka nyenkyakara nukwo baserre amarwa empotole, agabanywa bakaiza obwire, okuhika obu gakabazimbya! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ha magenyi gaabo, bateera enanga, endongo, engoma n'endere, banywa n'eviini; baitu tibatamu kitiinisa MUKAMA ebi yakozire kandi tibeetegereza ebi akora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nikyo abantu bange barukuzaahisizibwa habwokuba tibaina magezi; abantu baabo ababarukutamu ekitiinisa, enjara y'okubaita, kandi abantu baabo abaingi muno, iroho libali kubi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki nyabuyonga etuubire kandi eyesamire muno, neemira abantu ba Yerusaalemu ab'ekitiinisa n'abandi baingi, ekitebe ky'abantu baayo, n'ogu anyakugyenyumirizaamu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Buli muntu alihemurwa aswazibwe kandi abantu boona abeekuliiriza balibundaazibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baitu MUKAMA ow'amahe alyoleka nkooku ali mwinganiza omu kukora ebihikire, Ruhanga Omuhikiriire omu kukora ebirungi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obu nubwo ebyana by'entaama birirya nk'ebinyakuli omu irisizo, esajwa n'ebyana by'emburabuzi biririira omu bikambuuro.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balikibona abo abanyakuleeta obubi nibabiiha ebisuba, abanyakuserra ekibi nk'abasika emiguha y'ekigaali, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abanyakugamba bati: “Leka arahukye, leka amale bwango omulimo gwe nukwo tugurole!” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balikibona abo abanyakweta ekibi kirungi kandi abanyakweta ekirungi kibi, abanyakweta omwirima kyererezi kandi abeeta ekyererezi mwirima, abagira ekisaaliire ngu nikyo kirukunulirra kandi ekirukunulirra ngu nikyo kirukusarra!",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balikibona abo abeeyeta b'amagezi abanyakwesisaniza nk'abetegereza! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Balikibona abo abanywa amarwa bakatamiira abo abamanyire kugajwanganiza gakakooleera ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abanyakulekera abanyakwina omusango habwokuba babahaire enguzi, abanyakwanga kukorra obwinganiza abataina musango. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nk'orulimi rw'omurro oku rusiiriiza emisenka n'obunyansi obwomere nkooku gubuhwerekereza, ekikoro kyabo nukwo kirijunda kiti, n'orwakyo rwabo rulicuucuuka nk'ecuucu; habwokuba bakanga ebiragiro bya MUKAMA ow'amahe, baagaya ebigambo by'Ogu Arukwera wa Isirairi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habweki, MUKAMA abiihirirwe muno abantu be, amaliriire kubafubira. Ensozi niziija kutengeeta, kandi emitumbi y'abo abaafiire, niija kuba omu nguudo nk'ehunda. Habwokuba ekiniga tikikamuhoireho, kandi akyagoroire omukono. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "MUKAMA naija kusimiza ihanga erya hara aliterre akooya liruge ha mitaano y'ensi; hati murole, liizire bwango muno! ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Busaho muntu n'omu omulibo anyakujwaha, busaho n'omu anyakutabaijuka tiharoho n'omu anyakuhungira rundi kugwijagira, busaho anyakuteegukire orukoba; busaho anyakwina enkaito ecwekere orukoba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Emisogi yabo etoire, amata gaabo goona geegemere, enkangaasi z'embaraasi zaabo nizisisana ibaale kandi enyamuziga zaabo nizeezigura nizisisana nka kairiringwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 5:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okuburuguta kwabo nikusisana nk'okwentale, nibaburuguta nk'entale ensigazi; ziruruma nukwo ikwata ekisoro kyazo, zikiihaho ikitwara, busaho n'omu asobora kukinagiisa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.5.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.5.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
